title: Start
tags: intro
---
// The guard at the gate.
Guard: Halt! Who goes there? #line:g01 #stern
-> I'm a friend. #line:g02
    Guard: Pass, friend.
    <<set $friend to true>>
-> None of your business. <<if $rude is true>>
    Guard: Then turn back.
    <<jump Gate>>
<<if $friend>>
    Guard: Welcome, {$name}.
<<elseif $gold gt 10>>
    Guard: Nice purse.
<<else>>
    Guard: Move along.
<<endif>>
<<wait 1>>
The gate creaks: slowly.
Guard: Off you go. <<if $friend>> #line:g03
<<jump Gate>>
===
title: Gate
---
The gate opens.
<<declare $gold = 0>>
<<detour Start>>
<<stop>>
===
